  "description": "Design flight search and booking like MakeMyTrip, Cleartrip or Skyscanner: one-way and round-trip search with one-stop connections, caching and precomputed routes, aggregating 20-200 suppliers, seat holds with per-seat prices, multi-segment bookings with a payment saga, premium pricing, observability, testing, and the newer review-an-existing-design format.",
