    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">CRED</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Agoda</span><span class=\"chip company\">Paytm</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Flight Search &amp; Booking (MakeMyTrip / Skyscanner)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design a travel site that searches hundreds of airlines and agents in a couple of seconds, shows a price for every seat, and books a multi-flight trip without ever selling the same seat twice, even though other websites are selling those seats too.</p>\n      "
